# VM ALGO — Frontend environment variables
# Set this in Hostinger's environment variable UI (not in a committed .env file).
# It is intentionally NEXT_PUBLIC_ (readable by browser JS) — it's just the API
# base URL, not a secret. Actual secrets (JWT signing key, DB password, broker keys)
# are in backend/.env.example and never touch the frontend build.
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.vmalgo.com
